      "Block Design (WordColorStroop, 2 conditions)": 2,
      "This EEG study examined aesthetic and creative judgments of short poetry. Participants read and rated 210 texts, including 140 short poems (Haiku and Senryu) and 70 structurally matched control texts, on five dimensions: Aesthetic Appeal, Imagery, Emotional Impact, Originality, and Creativity. EEG was recorded throughout, with resting-state data collected before and after the task.": 2,
