      "### 1.1 Study Overview  This dataset forms part of an ongoing single-site Randomized Clinical Trial (RCT) involving adult burn patients admitted to the Intensive Care Unit (ICU). The key details of the study include:  - **Participants**: The study encompasses 82 adult burn patients admitted to the ICU. - **Randomization**: Participants were randomly assigned to either an intervention group or a control group in a 1:1 ratio. The intervention group received standard care in addition to a maximum of six Music therapy sessions provided by a certified music therapist over a 2-week period. - **Electrophysiological Measures**: Electrophysiological measures were taken from a subset of 9 participants in the intervention group (11%). - **Ethics and Registration**: The study was approved by the ethics committee of the Fundaci\u00f3n Santa Fe de Bogot\u00e1 (FSFB) with approval IDs CCEI-11234-2019 and CCEI-11971-2020. It is registered on Clinicaltrials.gov under the identifier NCT04571255. - **Informed Consent**: All participants": 1,
